eating a product with tags \\\"qatag, zephyr\\\", the /products Filters panel still lists the same 35 original seed tags — \\\"qanewtag\\\", \\\"massagegun\\\", \\\"qatag\\\" and \\\"zephyr\\\" are absent, so the new tag cannot be selected as a filter. The panel also still offers removed tags (\\\"massage\\\", \\\"therapy\\\") that no longer belong to any product.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"QA Test Gadget\\\" with Tags field \\\"qatag, zephyr\\\"; detail page lists both tags, and in-page search for \\\"Zephyr\\\" (mixed case) returned exactly that product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited Theragun Pro tags from \\\"recovery, massage, muscle, therapy\\\" to \\\"recovery, massagegun, muscle, qanewtag\\\" (add + rename + remove). Detail page shows exactly the new four tags; keyword search \\\"qanewtag\\\" returns 1 product (Theragun Pro).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create form's Category select offers exactly Tech Gadgets / Home Goods / Fitness (single-select). Chose Fitness; after saving, the admin card shows \\\"Fitness\\\" and the product appears on /category/fitness (4 items) and nowhere else.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products category filter: Tech Gadgets → 3 products found (all Tech), Home Goods → 3 (all Home), Fitness → 3 (all Fitness); count text and cards updated each time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products shows \\\"9 products found\\\"; each card exposes image, category badge (Tech/Home/Fitness), price, name link, brief description, star rating value, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" link to an external retailer URL.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort: Newest (default), Top Rated → 4.9→4.4 desc, Price Low→High ($199→$2,495), Price High→Low ($2,495→$199). Min rating 4.5+ → 8 products (Philips 4.4 excluded). Price slider dragged → max $1250 → 5 products all ≤$1250.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No persistence — all admin changes lost on reload\", \"actual\": \"After creating \\\"QA Test Gadget\\\"/\\\"QA Kitchen Marvel\\\", editing Theragun Pro's tags and un-featuring Dyson, reloading http://localhost:6001/ reset everything to the 9 seeded products (category counts back to Tech 3 / Home 3 / Fitness 3, Dyson featured again). /product/qa-kitchen-marvel returns \\\"Product Not Found\\\". localStorage is empty and there is no backend API, so state exists only in memory for the session.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Admin create/edit offers a single-choice Category select with exactly Tech Gadgets/Home Goods/Fitness; every card in list, category, homepage and detail views shows exactly one badge from that set; homepage category counts (Tech 3 + Home 4 + Fitness 3) equal the total of 10 products.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined filters (rating ≥4.5, max price $2410, tags headphones+coffee) → 2 results (Breville, Sony), each having at least one selected tag and satisfying price/rating; adding search \\\"SONY\\\" narrowed to 1 result satisfying all criteria.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incomplete products can be published; no validation feedback\", \"actual\": \"Created \\\"QA Incomplete Product\\\" with only name, category, price and short description — empty Image URL, empty Affiliate Link, empty Full Review and no specification. The form saved it and it now appears publicly at /products (11 products found) with an empty img src and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" link with no external href. Separately, submissions with price=-50 / rating=9 were rejected but with no error message, toast or field highlight at all.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/does-not-exist-123 → \\\"Product Not Found ... Browse All Products\\\" with 0 product cards; /category/bogus-cat → \\\"Category Not Found\\\" with 0 product cards.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category, sort, rating and price-slider changes each updated cards, order and the \\\"N products found\\\" counter live on /products with no navigation/reload (URL unchanged).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the \\\"Sony WH-1000XM5\\\" name on /products opened /product/sony-wh-1000xm5 showing that product; card image and name links both carry the same /product/<slug> href on every card.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Buy Now\\\" on Sony detail opened a new tab at https://example.com/sony-xm5. All Buy Now links use target=_blank rel=noopener and product-specific external retailer URLs (e.g. /macbook-pro, /s24-ultra).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selector on category pages is inert\", \"actual\": \"On /category/home the filter bar offers a category dropdown showing \\\"Home Goods\\\". Selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" and then \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\" left the dropdown reading \\\"Home Goods\\\", heading \\\"Home Goods\\\", URL /category/home and the same 3 Home products — neither the active category nor the displayed products changed. (The same control works correctly on /products.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\":